gUc(){return"Does this sign prohibit stopping for 3 minutes to pick up a passenger?"},
gUb(){return"No. It only prohibits parking on odd-numbered days. Stopping is permitted."},
gUk(){return"Does this sign eliminate overtaking and speed restrictions?"},
gUj(){return"Yes. It completes the action of signs 3.16, 3.20, 3.22, 3.24 and 3.26\u20133.30."},
gUm(){return"Does this sign override traffic signals and markings?"},
gUl(){return"No. Traffic lights and markings continue to operate."},
gUs(){return"The sign is at the beginning of the site. Can I turn right into the courtyard?"},
gUr(){return"Yes. At the beginning of the site, the sign is valid until the nearest intersection, but allows a right turn into the adjacent territory."},
gUu(){return"The sign is in front of the intersection. Can I turn left?"},
gUt(){return"No. At the nearest intersection of roadways, only straight traffic is allowed."},
gUw(){return"Do you need to turn right at the next intersection?"},
gUv(){return"Yes. For a regular car, the sign only allows right turns."},
