gUV(){return"No. This is the minimum speed. The maximum is limited by the sign 3.24."},
gVb(){return"Passenger car without trailer: general limit on the motorway 110 km/h?"},
gVa(){return"Yes. The general limit for a passenger car without a trailer is 110 km/h. Signs may set a different limit (clause 10.3)."},
