gVe(){return"No. The movement of mopeds on highways is prohibited (clause 16.1)."},
gVz(){return"Is reversing prohibited on this road?"},
gVy(){return"Yes. On the road for cars, the prohibitions of section 16 apply, as on the highway (clause 16.3)."},
gVB(){return"Can I stop on the side of the road just to relax?"},
gVA(){return"No. Intentional stopping is allowed in special areas. A forced stop is a separate case."},
gVD(){return"Is it possible to back up on a one-way road if it is safe and the place allows it?"},
